1
00:00:00,980 --> 00:00:02,810
(Sheldon:)but how can I leave
my body behind

2
00:00:02,816 --> 00:00:05,086
(Sheldon:)and become one
with the Internet

3
00:00:05,085 --> 00:00:07,785
(Sheldon:)when I've never even thrown
a toothbrush away?

4
00:00:09,989 --> 00:00:11,789
(Amy:)It's okay, Sheldon.

5
00:00:11,791 --> 00:00:15,231
You know, I... I've saved
a lot of weird things, too.

6
00:00:15,228 --> 00:00:17,428
(Raj:)Like what?

7
00:00:17,430 --> 00:00:19,360
(Amy:)Well, um,

8
00:00:19,365 --> 00:00:22,765
(Amy:)did you know
I have a microscope slide

9
00:00:22,769 --> 00:00:24,199
(Amy:)with a little bit of tissue

10
00:00:24,204 --> 00:00:27,204
(Amy:)from the first brain
I ever dissected?

11
00:00:27,207 --> 00:00:29,407
(Sheldon:)I have an old teddy bear

12
00:00:29,409 --> 00:00:32,009
(Sheldon:)I secretly wiped my nose on
for years.

13
00:00:38,918 --> 00:00:41,488
(Amy:)It's not a contest.

14
00:00:43,756 --> 00:00:46,326
(Penny:)Okay, here they come.
Go hide.

15
00:00:46,326 --> 00:00:48,396
(Raj:)Oh, man, when I come out
of the closet,

16
00:00:48,394 --> 00:00:50,994
I'm gonna nail those guys!

17
00:00:53,099 --> 00:01:00,019
(Raj:)Yeah, I heard it. Shut up.

